invalid type: string "Software purchases require manager approval and Security review before use.\n\nEquipment purchases must comply with Procurement Guidelines OPS-POL-002.\n\nCompany assets must be registered when required by the asset management process.\n\nPersonal devices and recurring personal subscriptions are not reimbursable without written business justification and approval.\n\nÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ